sentences.l:
And to Ida they came, many-fountained, mother of wild beasts,
and found far-thundering the son-of-Cronus on topmost Gargarus,
sitting;

But if to his words you will not give heed, but will disregard them,
he threatened that he too, head-on to fight,
would come here;

and he bids you to evade
his hands, since he says that than you in might far stronger he is
and earlier in birth;
